notes.notes:
[olist]
[*] 【Art Optimization】Replaced card faces and optimized the UI interface;
[*] 【New Feature】Voidwalker Artifact: Every 6 summons, additionally summon a random creature
[*] 【Performance Optimization】Optimized collision detection algorithm to improve game smoothness and reduce lag caused by too many monsters;
[*] 【Balance Adjustment】Universal Artifact: Draw Scroll triggers when the hand has less than or equal to 1 card instead of less than 0;
[*] 【Balance Adjustment】Difficulty adjustments, difficulty level 7 and beyond have been lowered;
[*] 【Function Optimization】Resolution optimization, set the device's default resolution as the initial resolution;
[*] 【BUG Fixes】Fixed the issue where the artifact counter became invalid after summoning
[*] 【BUG Fixes】Fixed missing attack sound effects for summoned creatures
[*] 【BUG Fixes】Fixed incorrect description of Hemorrhage
[/olist]

[olist]
[*] 【New Feature】Graphics optimization;
[*] 【New Feature】Right-click to quickly use the last card with a Return trait;
[*] 【New Feature】Shop item locks will now persist;
[*] 【Value Optimization】The general artifact Whetstone now grants +5 attack to the first attack card on the left side of your hand every 10 seconds;
[*] 【Value Optimization】Reduced the overall difficulty of Auto Chess Mode;
[*] 【Value Optimization】Reduced the difficulty level 10 of Strategic Mode;
[*] 【Value Optimization】The damage from elite archer mobs and the Felfire Trap will now scale with difficulty (previously fixed);
[*] 【Bug Fix】Fixed a bug where the shop would not display items;
[*] 【Bug Fix】Fixed a bug where the 99% achievement could not be triggered by 90%;
[*] 【Bug Fix】Fixed save file bugs;
[/olist]

[olist]
[*] [New function] You can unlock all difficulties and all illustrations in the upper left corner of the character selection interface;
[*] [New function] You need to clear difficulty 3 to unlock the same-professional team;
[*] [New function] Add more information to the failure interface;
[*] [New function] The mouse wheel can zoom in and out;
[*] [New function] The longer you persist in endless mode, the closer it is to dawn;
[*] [New function] Add 2 new achievements
[*] [BUG repair] Fixed the save bug;
[*] [BUG repair] Fixed the bug that the most practical achievement for money could not be obtained;
[*] [BUG repair] Fixed the bug of the mirror staff in the strategic mode;
[*] [BUG repair] Fixed the bug that the arrow of the card used when clearing the level did not disappear;
[/olist]

[olist]
[*] [New function] You can use characters of the same profession;
[*] [New function] Add statistical information to the clearance interface;
[*] [Game balance] The duration of the rotating ring is reduced from 5 seconds to 3 seconds;
[*] [Game balance] The phantom staff is changed from teammates using cards to teammates using equipment cards;
[*] [Game balance] Double the scroll to add debuff: hand card consumption +1;
[*] [Performance optimization] Optimize the lag problem of endless mode;
[*] [BUG repair] Fix the bug that the number of artifacts in the settlement interface does not refresh;
[/olist]

[olist]
[*] [Optimization adjustment] The second map (wilderness) adds day and night changes;
[*] [Optimization adjustment] Dragon Roar Slash adds sound effects;
[*] [BUG repair] Repair the bug that the unlocking conditions of the last artifact of the Void Walker are not uniform;
[*] [BUG repair] Repair the bug that the achievement triggers incorrectly;
[*] [BUG repair] Repair the bug that the endless mode affects the difficulty limit;
[*] [BUG repair] Repair the bug that the Void Walker can still move after death;
[*] [BUG repair] Repair the bug that the BGM will play when the information bar is closed on the store page
[/olist]

[olist]
[*] 【BUG Fix】Fixed a bug where the cooldown timer was not functioning correctly under double speed;
[*] 【BUG Fix】Fixed a bug where the mage would not descend after possessing the Lightning Orb;
[*] 【BUG Fix】Fixed a bug where the energy of the first position would not display properly when the warrior was in the second position;
[*] 【BUG Fix】Fixed a bug where the initial artifacts of the Void Walker in the first and second positions were not unlocked simultaneously;
[*] 【Optimization Adjustment】The maximum size of projectiles has been reduced from 6 to 2.5;
[*] 【Optimization Adjustment】Void Walker's skill card: Summoned Golem, has been changed from gaining 50 armor at the end of the turn to granting all allies 50 armor every 3 attacks by the golem;
[*] 【Optimization Adjustment】The mage's artifact [Ring of Rotation] effect has been adjusted to: within 5 seconds after a teammate uses a card, your projectile will rotate around you after its first collision with an enemy;
[/olist]
